{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel walked on dry land.</b> This verse is attached to the one above it: while the waters covered the chariots and the horsemen, all of Pharaoh's host, the children of Israel were walking on dry land. For two winds acted in the sea: 'With an east wind You heaped up the waters' — for Israel; 'You blew with Your wind, the sea covered them' — for Egypt."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:53.574325217Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}